@startuml
title D-04 Normal Payment-to-Exit Sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Parker / Cashier" as Actor
participant "WebPay or Assisted Terminal" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Payment Orchestrator" as POA
participant "Payment Provider" as Provider
participant "Resolved Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate
participant "Audit / Events" as Audit

Actor -> Channel : enter payment scope and session detail
Channel -> Central : request scope/session resolution
Central -> Vendor : resolve live session and normal tariff
Vendor --> Central : raw session and tariff result
Central -> Audit : record scope, Site, TariffSnapshot
Central --> Channel : present payable basis

Actor -> Channel : confirm payment
Channel -> Central : initiate payment attempt
Central -> POA : coordinate provider payment
POA -> Provider : provider interaction
Provider --> POA : provider outcome
POA --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central -> Audit : record platform payment finality

Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : fiscal identity / status
Central -> Audit : record fiscal reference

Central -> Gate : issue ExitAuthorization
Gate --> Central : consume authorization and report outcome
Central -> Audit : record gate outcome
Central --> Channel : display final status

note over POA,Central
Payment Orchestrator reports evidence.
Central PMS declares platform finality.
end note

note over POS,Gate
Normal ExitAuthorization follows successful
fiscal issuance and Central PMS fiscal reference recording.
end note
@enduml
